Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.86,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, that's just beautifully done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一下处理得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:55.02,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Talk about momentum changer.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一下改变了局势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.82,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the win in Mexico last year{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去年在墨西哥的夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:01.48,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}elevated her up into the top 50 for the first time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让她首次跻身世界前{\fs78}50{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:24.96,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's brilliant.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:27.50,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Great defence and a rapturous ovation{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N精彩防守赢得热烈欢呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:30.74,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from the crowd here enjoying this extra match{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N观众正享受这场加赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:32.50,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on court number two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在二号球场
