Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:48.51,TL,,0,0,0,,她化解对手两个局点 连得{\fs78}4{\fs68}个小分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:51.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 连赢{\fs78}6{\fs68}局结束比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:06.02,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N出界了！
