Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:12.74,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but Maja Chwalinska continues to break new ground{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但赫瓦林斯卡仍不断突破
