Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.48,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Kept her nerve, and how!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她顶住了压力 做得太出色了！
